","target":"secops-integration-get-network-stats-workflow","line":20},{"title":"Security Operations Integrations - Get Network Statistics flow","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/secops-integration-get-network-stats-workflow.md","line":24},{"title":"Security Incident Response- Get Network Statistics flow","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/obtain-network-statistics-workflow.md","line":26},{"title":"Security Incident Response","target":"sir-landing-page","line":27},{"title":"Integration capabilities","target":"integration-capabilities","line":29},{"title":"Sightings","target":"indicator-sightings","line":48},{"title":"Threat Lookup","target":"tisc-threat-lookup","line":50},{"title":"Security Operations Integrations - Get Network Statistics flow","target":"secops-integration-get-network-stats-workflow","line":56},{"title":"Integration capabilities","target":"integration-capabilities","line":57},{"title":"Security Incident Response","target":"sir-landing-page","line":58},{"title":"Sightings","target":"indicator-sightings","line":59},{"title":"Threat Lookup","target":"tisc-threat-lookup","line":60}],"metadata":{"title":"Security Operations Integration- Get Network Statistics capability","description":"The Get Network Statistics capability retrieves a list of active network connections from a host or endpoint. It can be used for incident enrichment during investigations. This capability is triggered automatically when a configuration item is added to a security incident.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/security-management/get-network-statistics-capability.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":2,"breadcrumb":["Integration capabilities","Security Operations Integration Reference","Security Operations c